    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: talking about health",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "改善「心理健康」要结合个人情况，不能照搬别人的做法。",
       "alumno": "To improve «psychological wellbeing», you have to take your personal situation into account and not simply copy what others do.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果出现明显或持续的症状，应及时向专业人员求助。",
       "alumno": "If clear or persistent symptoms appear, it is advisable to consult a professional in good time.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "提出解决办法时，还要考虑它会影响哪些人以及需要哪些资源。",
       "alumno": "When proposing a solution, you must also consider who it will affect and what resources it requires.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "清楚的结论要回应问题，并以具体细节为依据。",
       "alumno": "A clear conclusion answers the question and is based on concrete details.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
